@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### No dependency requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/liveness

### Check response X-Trace-Id / X-Probe-Sample-Id, then correlate JSON readiness logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness

### Optional upstream W3C trace context; the response keeps this trace ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness
traceparent: 00-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef-0123456789abcdef-01

### Read counters and recent failures without issuing dependency requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnostics/stats
